            <text><![CDATA[
<p>
    <span class="multilang" lang="en">
        We are given the matrices \(A = {@matrixa@}\) and \(B = {@matrixb@}\), and are asked to compute the products \(AB\) and \(BA\).
    </span>
    <span class="multilang" lang="de">
        Wir haben die Matrizen \(A = {@matrixa@}\) und \(B = {@matrixb@}\) gegeben und sollen die Produkte \(AB\) und \(BA\) berechnen.
    </span>
</p>
\[AB = {@CC@} = {@DD@}\] \[BA = {@EE@} = {@FF@}\]
]]></text>
